#: ac6868baffe448108892fb8f3bf48185
msgid "3DR Solo - ArduCopter Master Upgrade"
msgstr "3DR Solo - ArduCopter Master 升级"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:7
#: 00b9780e0e6a49acbbcade1b4f1a0e77
msgid ""
"This article details upgrading and operating ArduCopter version 3.5.0 and "
"higher a 3DR Solo."
msgstr "本文详细介绍了如何在 3DR Solo 上升级并使用 ArduCopter 3.5.0 及更高版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:10
#: f7493eae081446499455ce2e52e3934a
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:11
#: e91dbac431c24f09839f6705fc105800
msgid ""
"The 3DR Solo contains, among many things, a Pixhawk 2.0 autopilot. It comes "
"with a heavily customized branch of an early ArduCopter 3.3 compiled "
"specifically for the Solo by 3DR. When you do the initial pre-flight update "
"on a new Solo (or after a factory reset), part of that update is this Solo  "
"branch of ArduCopter. It is installed on the Pixhawk, and has all the "
"necessary default parameters and customizations baked into it. It is "
"essentially transparent to the user, taking place behind the curtains.  "
"Since 3DR is no longer in the consumer UAS business, this custom branch of "
"ArduCopter will not be seeing any further updates. It was last updated in "
"early 2016, and is now very far behind."
msgstr ""
"3DR Solo 内置了众多组件，其中包括一个 Pixhawk 2.0 飞控。它出厂时搭载了一个由 3DR 专门为 Solo 编译的、经过大量定制的早期"
" ArduCopter 3.3 分支版本。当您对新 Solo 进行首次飞行前更新（或出厂重置后），此次更新的一部分就是这个 Solo 专用的 "
"ArduCopter 分支，它被安装在 Pixhawk 上，并内置了所有必要的默认参数和定制配置，对用户来说基本是透明的，在幕后运行。由于 3DR "
"已退出消费级无人机市场，这个定制的 ArduCopter 分支将不再有任何更新。它最后一次更新是在 2016 年初，目前已大幅落后于主线版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:14
#: 5dacc668836241119e35bfe41fed983b
msgid "Life After 3DR"
msgstr "3DR 之后的新生"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:15
#: 2f1a527c41b4490b96d03af93c084a1e
msgid ""
"Since the Solo uses a Pixhawk autopilot, it is capable of running variations"
" of ArduCopter besides the 3DR customized Solo version. This article will "
"focus on installing, configuring, and operating ArduCopter version 3.5.0 or "
"higher on a 3DR Solo. ArduCopter continues where 3DR left off, keeping the "
"Solo a modern, advanced, and highly capable sUAS.  There are countless "
"advances in the autopilot firmware making it a more stable, reliable, and "
"agile aircraft. There are many new features such as boat mode, RTK GPS, "
"enhanced telemetry, ADS-B, lidar laser altimeters, terrain awareness and "
"following, IR precision landing, and even and \"indoor GPS\"."
msgstr ""
"由于 Solo 使用的是 Pixhawk 飞控，因此它能够运行除 3DR 定制 Solo 版本之外的其他 ArduCopter "
"变体。本文将重点介绍如何在 3DR Solo 上安装、配置和使用 ArduCopter 3.5.0 或更高版本。ArduCopter 在 3DR "
"停止支持后继续发展，使 Solo "
"保持现代化、先进且高度可用的小型无人机状态。飞控固件有无数改进，使飞行更加稳定、可靠且灵活。还增加了许多新功能，如船只模式、RTK "
"GPS、增强型数传、ADS-B、激光雷达测距仪、地形感知与跟随、红外精确降落，甚至还有\"室内 GPS\"功能。"

