#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:32
#: 321214bcb86c41eb933f0ece4a34e185
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "硬件要求"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:33
#: 12b6ef6cc2594d96aba514cc0e0c3817
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk 2.1 Green Cube (or a traditional Cube with the internal jumper "
"set for 5 volts) is currently required for safe and reliable use of "
"ArduCopter 3.5.0 and higher on a 3DR Solo. You can purchase the Green Cube "
"from `Jesters Drones "
"<http://www.jestersdrones.org/store/index.php?rt=product/category&path=68>`_"
" or directly from  `ProfiCNC <http://www.proficnc.com/3dr-solo-"
"accessories/79-the-cube.html>`_.  The Cube has significantly more advanced "
"components.  This includes 3 temperature controlled IMUs and the 5 volt "
"signalling the Solo needs to operate safely. If you already have a Cube, you"
" can set an internal solder jumper to 5 volt signalling and use it in your "
"Solo.  The Green Cube comes with this jumper pre-set for 5 volts."
msgstr ""
"目前，在 3DR Solo 上安全可靠地使用 ArduCopter 3.5.0 及更高版本需要 Pixhawk 2.1 Green "
"Cube（或内部跳线设置为 5 伏的传统 Cube）。您可以从 `Jesters Drones "
"<http://www.jestersdrones.org/store/index.php?rt=product/category&path=68>`_"
" 或直接从 `ProfiCNC <http://www.proficnc.com/3dr-solo-accessories/79-the-"
"cube.html>`_ 购买 Green Cube。The Cube 拥有更加先进的硬件组件，包括 3 个温控 IMU 以及 Solo 安全运行所需的"
" 5 伏信号。如果您已有 Cube，可以将内部焊接跳线设置为 5 伏信号后用于 Solo。Green Cube 出厂时已预设此跳线为 5 伏。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:40
#: d4f4a7cf0924463aa1d02097552609f6
msgid ""
"You *can* install ArduCopter master on the stock Pixhawk 2.0, but it is "
"highly discouraged. It will install, and it will fly.  But you are at fairly"
" high risk for motors shutting down in flight, leading to a serious crash. "
"This is because of an electrical hardware flaw in the Solo's motor pods.  "
"The old stock firmware has a software patch to *mostly* mitigate this flaw. "
"This is what you may hear referred to as \"slew rate protection\". You can "
"view the code for the slew rate protection in the stock 3DR firmware `here "
"on their GitHub site <https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-"
"solo/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.cpp#L388>`_.  The "
"production versions of ArduCopter, including ArduCopter 3.5 do not have this"
" slew rate protection. It is severely handicapping and difficult to manage "
"for a world of vehicles that use ArduCopter besides the Solo.  The 5 volt "
"signalling used in the Pixhawk 2.1 Green Cube effectively solves the "
"electrical problem on the motor pods."
msgstr ""
"您*可以*在原装 Pixhawk 2.0 上安装 ArduCopter "
"master，但强烈不建议这样做。它可以安装并飞行，但电机在飞行中意外关闭导致严重坠机的风险相当高。这是由于 Solo "
"电机舱存在电气硬件缺陷。原装固件通过软件补丁*基本上*缓解了这一缺陷，也就是您可能听说过的\"斜率保护（slew rate "
"protection）\"。您可以在 `这里的 3DR GitHub 站点 "
"<https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-"
"solo/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.cpp#L388>`_ 上查看原装 3DR "
"固件中斜率保护的代码。包括 ArduCopter 3.5 在内的 ArduCopter 量产版本均不包含此斜率保护，因为它对于使用 ArduCopter"
" 的众多其他飞行器来说过于限制且难以管理。Pixhawk 2.1 Green Cube 使用的 5 伏信号从根本上解决了电机舱的电气问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:42
#: fbf0d6d81a264c16b6f500b9f66455b6
msgid ""
"There are other potential ways to mitigate the electrical problem with the "
"motor pods without buying a new Cube.  You could use conventional DIY ESCs "
"and bypass the ones built into the motor pods.  Or you could build a level "
"converter that steps the signalling voltage up from 3v to 5v.  None of these"
" solutions are commercially available as a kit, but can be done on a DIY "
"basis if you are creative. You would not have the benefit of enhanced "
"hardware in The Cube, but it would be just as safe and reliable to fly."
msgstr ""
"还有其他一些在不购买新 Cube 的情况下缓解电机舱电气问题的方法。您可以使用普通 DIY ESC 并绕过电机舱内置的 ESC，或者制作一个将信号电压从"
" 3V 升压到 5V 的电平转换器。这些方案目前没有商业化的套件可购买，但如果您有创意，可以自己动手实现。虽然您无法享受 The Cube "
"增强硬件带来的好处，但飞行的安全性和可靠性与之相当。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:44
#: 1e6b8def8a82402bad4879de34826838
msgid ""
"You cannot use the old stock 3DR Solo firmware on the Cube. It is entirely "
"incompatible. This also means you cannot do a factory reset on the Solo with"
" The Cube still in the Solo. The factory reset tries to reload the old Solo "
"firmware, which is incompatible.  If you need to Factory Reset, you will "
"need to put the old stock Pixhawk 2.0 back in, run the full factory reset "
"and update, then put the Green Cube back in. This is annoying, but there is "
"no way around it now or in the foreseeable future. In short, do not need to "
"factory reset. Which also means do not lose your WiFi password!  Do not "
"throw away your old stock cube!"
msgstr ""
"您无法在 Cube 上使用原装 3DR Solo 固件，两者完全不兼容。这也意味着在 Solo 中装有 The Cube "
"的情况下无法进行出厂重置，因为出厂重置会尝试重新加载与之不兼容的旧 Solo 固件。如果需要出厂重置，您需要先将原装 Pixhawk 2.0 "
"装回，完整执行出厂重置和更新，然后再将 Green Cube "
"装回。这很麻烦，但目前及可预见的将来都没有解决办法。简而言之，尽量避免需要出厂重置的情况，也就是说不要忘记 WiFi 密码！不要丢弃您的原装 Cube！"

