msgstr "此处提供了两种有详细说明的升级方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:87
#: f0970103e29a494ca5e67429c6bcb33e
msgid ""
":ref:`Initial installation using the Solex app "
"<solo_arducopter_solex_install>`. This is by far the most straight forward "
"and highly recommended method.  Solex has the means to load and reset "
"firmware and parameters, and has access to all the necessary files online "
"directly."
msgstr ""
":ref:`使用 Solex 应用进行初始安装 "
"<solo_arducopter_solex_install>`。这是迄今为止最直接且强烈推荐的方法。Solex "
"可以加载和重置固件及参数，并能直接在线访问所有必要文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:88
#: 5dfd89874df148a99483489dabd9c400
msgid ""
":ref:`Initial installation using Mission Planner and WinSCP "
"<solo_arducopter_other_install>`. This method is a little more involved but "
"is just as successful. You will need to download zip files, use Mission "
"Planner to change settings, and use WinSCP to transfer files.  If you do not"
" have the Solex app, this is the method you will need to follow."
msgstr ""
":ref:`使用 Mission Planner 和 WinSCP 进行初始安装 "
"<solo_arducopter_other_install>`。此方法稍微复杂一些，但同样有效。您需要下载 zip 文件，使用 Mission "
"Planner 更改设置，并使用 WinSCP 传输文件。如果您没有 Solex 应用，则需要采用此方法。"

