#: b89091bb331e4ef7b7690fe56178b43a
msgid "Make sure you are getting a good GPS lock"
msgstr "确保 GPS 锁定良好"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:119
#: c73b53cb08ca40299e689c12997aa0e7
msgid ""
"Make sure the distance, altitude, speed, modes, and GPS data displayed on "
"the app and controller are correct and as you expect to see."
msgstr "确保应用程序和遥控器上显示的距离、高度、速度、飞行模式和 GPS 数据正确且符合预期。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:120
#: 8728c202895b4bdfa80ea7c77ceefa71
msgid ""
"Let the battery run down to the failsafe while hovering safely nearby. "
"Observe its behavior and verify it appropriately executed the RTH/RTM "
"procedure."
msgstr "在附近安全悬停，让电池电量耗尽至失控保护触发。观察其行为，确认它正确执行了 RTH/RTM 程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:122
#: ac8be83d2d7e44bb8cc3e5556d819212
msgid ""
"If you need help troubleshooting a problem during with this process or have "
"questions, the `Solo Beta Test Facebook group "
"<https://www.facebook.com/groups/617648671719759/>`_ is the best place to "
"go."
msgstr ""
"如果您在此过程中遇到问题需要排查，或有任何疑问，`Solo Beta Test Facebook group "
"<https://www.facebook.com/groups/617648671719759/>`_ 是最佳求助地点。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:132
#: c47ba344cb7147b5ab1ba92a4e40bab9
msgid "ArduCopter Parameters"
msgstr "ArduCopter 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:133
#: 36832f59cb894ff3aca792954a7c3923
msgid ""
"There are over 700 parameters in ArduCopter. For everyday use of the Solo, "
"you still do not need to worry about any of them. They're all pre-set for "
"you in the above processes and by way of defaults.  All the configuration "
"parameters for the Solo that require a value different from the ArduCopter "
"defaults can be found in the `ArduPilot GitHub repository "
"/tools/frame_params/ directory "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Solo_AC35.param>`_."
" These are the parameters that are loaded during the upgrade process. If you"
" are not familiar with editting parameters and have no special use case to "
"warrant changing them, altering them is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"ArduCopter 中有超过 700 个参数。对于日常使用 Solo "
"的用户，您仍然无需关心任何参数，它们在上述流程中以及通过默认值已为您预先设置好。Solo 所有需要与 ArduCopter 默认值不同的配置参数，均可在"
" `ArduPilot GitHub 仓库的 /tools/frame_params/ 目录 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Solo_AC35.param>`_"
" 中找到。这些是在升级过程中加载的参数。如果您不熟悉参数编辑且没有特殊使用场景需要修改，建议不要随意更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:135
#: 1dbb7b4674db4bebae9cf2351bcad4e1
msgid ""
"However, there are some advanced and special use cases that may require "
"changing some parameters. Some key parameters for advanced users are "
"detailed below. This list will likely grow as new use cases and "
"modifications develop."
msgstr ""
"然而，某些高级和特殊使用场景可能需要修改某些参数。以下详细介绍了一些针对高级用户的关键参数，随着新使用场景和改装方案的发展，此列表将会继续扩充。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:139
#: 9725918e428546d997509df5aaf59527
msgid ""
":ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT <COMPASS_ORIENT>` is the orientation of the external "
"compass."
msgstr ":ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT <COMPASS_ORIENT>` 是外部罗盘的方向设置。"

