msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:155
#: 4600b10838e44b03a5df5f14acd8cb1e
msgid "Land only, no RTH/RTM. This is useful for indoor flying."
msgstr "仅就地降落，不执行 RTH/RTM。适用于室内飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:159
#: 8a6a9d3968544cc0925cac9d167656e0
msgid ""
"FS_BATT_ENABLE controls the low battery failsafe action for Copter-3.5 (and "
"earlier). For Copter-3.6 (and higher) check the :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` parameter. The low battery failsafe kicks in when when "
"the values set in parameters ``FS_BATT_VOLTAGE`` or ``FS_BATT_MAH`` are "
"breached."
msgstr ""
"FS_BATT_ENABLE 控制 Copter-3.5（及更早版本）的低电量失控保护动作。对于 Copter-3.6（及更高版本），请查看 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 参数。当 ``FS_BATT_VOLTAGE`` 或 "
"``FS_BATT_MAH`` 参数中设定的值被触及时，低电量失控保护将触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:163
#: a9d24ef39a3f49838d8d621b15bd61e0
msgid "No failsafe action"
msgstr "无失控保护动作"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:164
#: 42a6a8aabe3742c891122426a15c0b7a
msgid "Land immediately, no RTH/RTM. Useful for indoors."
msgstr "立即就地降落，不执行 RTH/RTM。适用于室内飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:165
#: 481c37c52348465398b92cb239f05e5e
msgid "RTH/RTM"
msgstr "RTH/RTM"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:169
#: 87afadfab3124dfba7dd246d0614e808
msgid ""
"FS_BATT_VOLTAGE is the low battery voltage threshold for Copter-3.5 (and "
"earlier). For Copter-3.6 (and higher) check the :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter. When the battery voltage drops below this point,"
" the low battery beeper sounds and it will do what you have "
"``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` set for. This value is expressed in volts. The default is"
" 14.0. You can adjust this higher or lower depending on use case and "
"preference."
msgstr ""
"FS_BATT_VOLTAGE 是 Copter-3.5（及更早版本）的低电压阈值。对于 Copter-3.6（及更高版本），请查看 "
":ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数。当电池电压低于此值时，低电量蜂鸣器将响起，并执行 "
"``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` 中设定的动作。此值以伏特为单位，默认值为 14.0。您可以根据使用场景和偏好调整此值的高低。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:173
#: 2b80aaf7f6514f648020587e194e9eeb
msgid "No low voltage alarm or failsafe"
msgstr "无低电压报警或失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:174
#: 51869790169844cca99bd1e66b0c5145
msgid "14"
msgstr "14"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:174
#: e6a72aa174654918b877b39e55629949
msgid "14 volts"
msgstr "14 伏"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:179
#: 71b5f808830f4e4480a2ba70b8ec69fd
msgid ""
"FS_BATT_MAH is the battery capacity remaining threshold expressed in "
"milliamperes (MAH) for Copter-3.5 (and earlier). For Copter-3.6 (and higher)"
" check the :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter. When the battery "
"remaining capacity drops below this point, the low battery beeper sounds and"
" it will do what you have ``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` set for. The default is 520. On"
" the solo, that is on average about 1.5 minutes of flying time remaining. "
"You can adjust this up or down to fit your preference and use case. Setting "
"it for 0 will disable capacity remaining based alarms and failsafes."
msgstr ""
"FS_BATT_MAH 是 Copter-3.5（及更早版本）以毫安时（MAH）表示的剩余电池容量阈值。对于 Copter-3.6（及更高版本），请查看"
" :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数。当剩余电池容量低于此值时，低电量蜂鸣器将响起，并执行 "
"``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` 中设定的动作。默认值为 520，在 Solo 上平均约相当于 1.5 "
"分钟的飞行时间。您可以根据偏好和使用场景调整此值。设置为 0 将禁用基于剩余容量的报警和失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:183
#: 9210e1ed43454e55a30e1753c9105a0b
msgid "No battery capacity remaining alarm or failsafe"
msgstr "无剩余电池容量报警或失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:184
#: a7c5051a024a425bb71eb6f8231f01ba
msgid "520"
msgstr "520"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:184
#: 8dc8eb81ed0242d9afb85be42c3b1013
msgid "520 MAH"
msgstr "520 MAH"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:189
#: 0884099fc72f4833adcde611ad0f46ec
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR <WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR>` specifies the yaw behavior in auto "
"missions and RTH/RTM."
msgstr ":ref:`WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR <WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR>` 指定自动任务和 RTH/RTM 中的偏航行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:193
#: e46d8445cb5942bf9fd07475264c161d
msgid ""
"No change. The Solo's yaw will keep pointing in the same direction unless "
"you change it."
msgstr "不变。Solo 的偏航将保持同一方向，除非您主动更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:194
#: 45099db84a724d81804ee35f2e4f7241
msgid "Face the next waypoint regardless of direction of flight."
msgstr "无论飞行方向如何，始终朝向下一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:195
#: 4a8294d005e5482e80f445c229c6ae19
msgid "Face the next waypoint except in RTH/RTM."
msgstr "朝向下一个航点，RTH/RTM 时除外。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:196
#: 728ecd68204d42b7969a2c3190b8ba5c
msgid "Face forward along the GPS course."
msgstr "沿 GPS 航迹方向朝前。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:200
#: 363fa33561d24a96a23c4384f6a2546e
msgid ""
"**NTF_OREO_THEME** controls the Solo's motor pod LED theme. This is for "
"ArduCopter 3.5.0 and higher only."
msgstr "**NTF_OREO_THEME** 控制 Solo 电机舱 LED 主题。仅适用于 ArduCopter 3.5.0 及更高版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:204
#: 13f598070b864ce4861219828b3bd4f6
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:205
#: 10cc81f93c0248d093f0596b4be720de
msgid "Aircraft theme with red/green front and white strobes rear."
msgstr "飞机主题：前方红/绿灯，后方白色频闪灯。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:206
#: 1b47131efe1949bd88fe8c9d9af6007f
msgid ""
"Rover theme with white front & red rear (like a stock Solo used to be)."
msgstr "地面车辆主题：前方白灯，后方红灯（与原装 Solo 相同）。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:210
#: 779688d6c04c480e85be8311120b8020
msgid ""
":ref:`AHRS_GPS_USE <AHRS_GPS_USE>` is for enabling or disabling the GPS on "
"you Solo. The default is 1 for enabled. The primary use case for disabling "
"the GPS is for indoor flight. If the GPS is disabled, it cannot and will not"
" try to use it for flight, failsafes, or any other function. That means RTH "
"mode is not available. You must be familiar with how the failsafes work "
"without a GPS. In most cases, the Solo will land since it cannot RTH."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AHRS_GPS_USE <AHRS_GPS_USE>` 用于启用或禁用 Solo 的 GPS。默认值为 1（启用）。禁用 GPS "
"的主要使用场景是室内飞行。如果禁用 GPS，飞控将不会尝试将其用于飞行、失控保护或任何其他功能，这意味着 RTH 模式不可用。您必须熟悉在没有 GPS "
"情况下失控保护的工作方式，在大多数情况下，由于无法执行 RTH，Solo 将就地降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:214
#: 032d7830db5f439b80467c0b8bf7255d
msgid "GPS disabled"
msgstr "GPS 禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:215
#: db4aeb4219f349fab61bb26dc97e50bb
msgid "GPS enabled"
msgstr "GPS 启用"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:219
#: 6a2a8815c2824547b1050aecb3513416
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` enables and disables dataflash (\\*.bin) "
"logging when the Solo is disarmed.  It is currently enabled by default since"
" it can be very useful for testing and troubleshooting. But it does result "
"in large and often unneccessary logs.  If you are comfortable and confident "
"in your Solo, you disable logging while disarmed.  The dataflash logs be "
"much cleaner and volumnous."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` 用于启用或禁用 Solo 上锁时的 "
"dataflash（\\*.bin）日志记录。由于对测试和故障排查非常有用，目前默认启用。但这会产生大量且通常不必要的日志。如果您对 Solo "
"的状态感到满意和有信心，可以禁用上锁状态下的日志记录，这样 dataflash 日志将更加简洁和精简。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:223
#: 61049575d7d442eaa7ec4d9ccacae5ca
msgid "Disabled / No dataflash logging while disarmed"
msgstr "禁用 / 上锁时不记录 dataflash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:224
#: 3919c83875dd4cfdab9e0b9c1f68e4ec
msgid "Enabled / Dataflash logging while disarmed and armed."
msgstr "启用 / 上锁和解锁时均记录 dataflash 日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:229
#: 3edd4c48cc5a4b2390da44eef571f646
msgid "Further Information"
msgstr "更多信息"
